  "interpretation": "<ul>\n<li data-start=\"1179\" data-end=\"1341\">\n<p data-start=\"1181\" data-end=\"1208\"><span style=\"font-size: 11px;\"><strong data-start=\"1181\" data-end=\"1206\">Negative (&lt;40 IU/mL):</strong></span></p>\n<ul data-start=\"1211\" data-end=\"1341\">\n<li style=\"font-size: 11px;\" data-start=\"1211\" data-end=\"1266\">\n<p data-start=\"1213\" data-end=\"1266\"><span style=\"font-size: 11px;\">No evidence of recent infection or immune response.</span></p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 11px;\" data-start=\"1269\" data-end=\"1341\">\n<p data-start=\"1271\" data-end=\"1341\"><span style=\"font-size: 11px;\">May indicate susceptibility (no prior vaccination or waning immunity).</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 11px;\" data-start=\"1343\" data-end=\"1536\">\n<p data-start=\"1345\" data-end=\"1376\"><span style=\"font-size: 11px;\"><strong data-start=\"1345\" data-end=\"1374\">Equivocal (40&ndash;100 IU/mL):</strong></span></p>\n<ul data-start=\"1379\" data-end=\"1536\">\n<li style=\"font-size: 11px;\" data-start=\"1379\" data-end=\"1461\">\n<p data-start=\"1381\" data-end=\"1461\"><span style=\"font-size: 11px;\">Could reflect <strong data-start=\"1395\" data-end=\"1458\">past infection, recent vaccination, or early seroconversion</strong>.</span></p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 11px;\" data-start=\"1464\" data-end=\"1536\">\n<p data-start=\"1466\" data-end=\"1536\"><span style=\"font-size: 11px;\">Recommend <strong data-start=\"1476\" data-end=\"1511\">repeat testing after 10&ndash;14 days</strong> if clinically indicated.</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 11px;\" data-start=\"1538\" data-end=\"1722\">\n<p data-start=\"1540\" data-end=\"1568\"><span style=\"font-size: 11px;\"><strong data-start=\"1540\" data-end=\"1566\">Positive (&gt;100 IU/mL):</strong></span></p>\n<ul data-start=\"1571\" data-end=\"1722\">\n<li style=\"font-size: 11px;\" data-start=\"1571\" data-end=\"1668\">\n<p data-start=\"1573\" data-end=\"1668\"><span style=\"font-size: 11px;\">Suggestive of <strong data-start=\"1587\" data-end=\"1639\">recent or current Bordetella pertussis infection</strong> OR <strong data-start=\"1643\" data-end=\"1665\">recent vaccination</strong>.</span></p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 11px;\" data-start=\"1671\" data-end=\"1722\">\n<p data-start=\"1673\" data-end=\"1722\"><span style=\"font-size: 11px;\">Correlate with <strong data-start=\"1688\" data-end=\"1721\">clinical symptoms and history</strong>.</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 11px;\" data-start=\"1724\" data-end=\"1914\">\n<p data-start=\"1726\" data-end=\"1746\"><span style=\"font-size: 11px;\"><strong data-start=\"1726\" data-end=\"1744\">For Diagnosis:</strong></span></p>\n<ul data-start=\"1749\" data-end=\"1914\">\n<li style=\"font-size: 11px;\" data-start=\"1749\" data-end=\"1832\">\n<p data-start=\"1751\" data-end=\"1832\"><span style=\"font-size: 11px;\">Rising titers in <strong data-start=\"1768\" data-end=\"1811\">paired samples (acute and convalescent)</strong> are most reliable.</span></p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 11px;\" data-start=\"1835\" data-end=\"1914\">\n<p data-start=\"1837\" data-end=\"1914\"><span style=\"font-size: 11px;\">May be combined with <strong data-start=\"1858\" data-end=\"1886\">PCR for direct detection</strong> if acute disease suspected.</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>",
